L000392	This behavior persists till the critical sampling time
L000393	\begin{equation}
L000394	    \Delta E~ \tau_c = 2 \pi,
L000395	\end{equation}
L000396	with $\Delta E = \left( E_{\max} -E_{\min} \right)= 4$ (\emph{i.e.}, $\tau_c=\pi/2$ as pointed out before), the two endpoints meet, $a_1(\tau)=a_2(\tau)=-1$, and the arc closes (Fig.~\ref{letter-fig-pole}(b)).
